ooter", "adventure"], "long_description": "We invite you to face your fears in a disturbing and mind-bending series of adventures... all taking place within The Twilight Zone\u2122. This game features elements of stealth, shooting, escape mechanics and eye-popping visuals.\n\nStory 1: CHARACTER BUILDING - A video game director discovers that workplace cruelty is a dangerous game.  \n\nStory 2: TERROR FIRMA - After an environmental apocalypse, one survivor must face mysterious phantoms as he searches the city ruins for a glimmer of Hope. \n\nStory 3: DEADLINE EARTH - The clock is ticking for a science fiction writer who finds himself captive on an insidious alien vessel.\n\n---------------------------------------\n\n\u00a9 2022 Software - Fun Train Media LLC\n\nTM & \u00a9 1959 CBS  TM & \u00a9 2022 A CBS Company. THE TWILIGHT ZONE and related marks and logos are trademarks of A CBS Company. All Rights Reserved. \n\n\u201cTwilight Zone\u201d (Main Title) Writer: Marius Constant\nUsed by Permission of Sony/ATV Music Publishing LLC. All Rights Reserved\n", "short_description": "You will be traveling through another dimension. A dimension not only of sight and sound but of the mind.  You are invited to enter\u2026 The Twilight Zone\u2122. \n\nThe producers that brought you the horror hit The Exorcist: Legion now present a new mind-bending anthology game featuring interwoven tales of science fiction, horror and mystery with game types including stealth, shooting and escape challenges.  "}]}, "developer_name": "Pocket Money Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.twilightzonevr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.twilightzonevr.com/eula", "publisher_name": "Fun Train", "support_website_url": "https://www.twilightzonevr.com/support", "website_url": "http://www.TwilightZoneVR.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category":